nings/call-transcripts/2018/08/14/viavi-solutions-inc-viav-q4-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"VIAV 2018 Q4","e":"viav","d":"2018-08-14","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"As Amar said, we are raising our guidance for the business to the higher end of the guidance of roughly $245 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/14/viavi-solutions-inc-viav-q4-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"VIAV 2019 Q1","e":"viav","d":"2018-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Amar Maletira","x":"At this time point in time, we don't see material impact to our P&L, because of tariffs so -- and we'll continue to monitor the situation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/viavi-solutions-viav-q1-2019-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"VIAV 2019 Q1","e":"viav","d":"2018-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"James Kisner","x":"I'm just wondering are any of your products in the current products targeted for tariffs, or they may be on the new list if they're not?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/viavi-solutions-viav-q1-2019-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"VIAV 2019 Q1","e":"viav","d":"2018-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"Our SE business segment, post-restructuring, continues to perform to our expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/viavi-solutions-viav-q1-2019-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"VIAV 2019 Q1","e":"viav","d":"2018-11-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Amar Maletira","x":"And hence, we increased our guidance from $50 million to $60 million and with the same ratio of having about 75% of that revenue show up in first half versus second half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/02/viavi-solutions-viav-q1-2019-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"VIAV 2019 Q2","e":"viav","d":"2019-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"The restructuring of the NSE business segment along with the OpEx optimization over the past three years have created a strong operating leverage to VIAVI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/05/viavi-solutions-inc-viav-q2-2019-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"VIAV 2019 Q2","e":"viav","d":"2019-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Amar Maletira","x":"We would like to drive it as a new norm going forward, but you know, let's, so this is one thing that we have been consistently talking about for the last few quarters, the restructuring that we drove, the cost structure that we have created.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/05/viavi-solutions-inc-viav-q2-2019-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"VIAV 2019 Q4","e":"viav","d":"2019-08-15","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"And provided there's North American tariffs in importation of these products, North America obviously gives us some exposure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/16/viavi-solutions-viav-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"VIAV 2020 Q1","e":"viav","d":"2019-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Amar Maletira","x":"So when you think about looking forward for fiscal ' 20, we want to maintain the guidance we provided.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/viavi-solutions-viav-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"VIAV 2020 Q1","e":"viav","d":"2019-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Amar Maletira","x":"So overall, we will maintain the guidance that we provided.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/viavi-solutions-viav-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"VIAV 2022 Q1","e":"viav","d":"2021-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"But more importantly, we've also been systemically implementing over the last several quarters, price increases, which, in some cases, already started going into effect very early, but really will kick in beginning of the calendar year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/07/viavi-solutions-inc-viav-q1-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VIAV 2022 Q1","e":"viav","d":"2021-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"I mean you're seeing across the board 10% to 20% price increases on semi components probably starting, I would say, in earnest beginning of January.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/07/viavi-solutions-inc-viav-q1-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"VIAV 2022 Q2","e":"viav","d":"2022-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Henk Derksen","x":"The reduction is a result of nonrecurring tax payments executed during the quarter mainly related to a restructuring project executed during fiscal Q4 of 2021, as well as a temporary increase in inventory levels in anticipation of increased future demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/03/viavi-solutions-viav-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VIAV 2022 Q2","e":"viav","d":"2022-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"The SC turnaround is a result of our restructuring of the business segment in early calendar 2017 and subsequent launch of common Nitro platform for the assurance and data center market segments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/03/viavi-solutions-viav-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VIAV 2022 Q3","e":"viav","d":"2022-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"And some of the new segments like ORAN and with the 5G and our revamped SC business, we actually think we're going to be in a higher growth segment than we were -- while we were restructuring the business kind of from the JDS Uniphase days to the modern Viavi.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/03/viavi-solutions-viav-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"VIAV 2024 Q4","e":"viav","d":"2025-01-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Genovese","x":"I just have one question, which is, you know, Oleg, you've spoken a lot about how AI and data center investment, you know, can improve or help field tests over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/viavi-viav-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIAV 2024 Q4","e":"viav","d":"2025-01-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Genovese","x":"And so, you know, is the Lumen announcement about their investment in AI, is that key to the second half recovery or, you know, other things like that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/viavi-viav-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIAV 2024 Q4","e":"viav","d":"2025-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ilan Daskal","x":"In June 2024, we initiated a restructuring and workforce reduction plan to improve operational efficiencies and better align with the current business needs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/viavi-viav-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIAV 2024 Q4","e":"viav","d":"2025-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ilan Daskal","x":"We expect approximately 6% of our global workforce to be impacted and estimate to incur approximately $15 million of restructuring charges in connection with this plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/viavi-viav-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIAV 2026 Q1","e":"viav","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"The data center ecosystem, which includes high-performance semis, optical modules, and NAMs, drove strong demand for production products in support of the AI data center build-out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/viavi-viav-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIAV 2026 Q1","e":"viav","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"In addition, we are now also seeing a growing demand for our traditional field instruments by hyperscalers as they build out and operate their new AI data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/viavi-viav-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIAV 2026 Q2","e":"viav","d":"2026-01-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"The data center ecosystem, which includes high-performance semis, optical modules, and NAMS, drove strong demand for lead and production products in support of AI data center build-out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/viavi-viav-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIAV 2026 Q2","e":"viav","d":"2026-01-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"Well, if you go to one of these AI data centers, you see at the edge they are they want to monitor every incoming you know, wavelength.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/viavi-viav-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIAV 2026 Q2","e":"viav","d":"2026-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ilan Daskal","x":"Last week, we approved a restructuring and workforce reduction plan to improve operational efficiencies and better align workforce and resources with our current business needs and strategic priorities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/viavi-viav-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIAV 2026 Q2","e":"viav","d":"2026-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ilan Daskal","x":"We expect approximately 5% of our global workforce to be impacted and estimate to incur approximately $32 million restructuring charges in connection with this plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/28/viavi-viav-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VIAV 2026 Q3","e":"viav","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Oleg Khaykin","x":"The data center ecosystem, which includes high-performance semis, optical modules, NAMs, and the 